00:46:08.762 --> 00:46:10.664
<font color=#0080C0>Hmm-mm. I don't know.</font>

609
00:46:10.698 --> 00:46:12.333
<font color=#0080C0>I don't think so.</font>

610
00:46:12.366 --> 00:46:14.335
<font color=#0080C0>Mm, no. I don't think so.</font>

