00:46:25.346 --> 00:46:27.381
<font color=#0080C0>And I never went downstairs?</font>

616
00:46:27.414 --> 00:46:29.650
<font color=#0080C0>Nope.</font>

617
00:46:31.318 --> 00:46:33.219
<font color=#0080C0>Do you like it here?</font>

618
00:46:33.253 --> 00:46:34.521
<font color=#0080C0>In this room?</font>

