00:46:37.391 --> 00:46:39.192
<font color=#0080C0>No. Do you?</font>

621
00:46:39.226 --> 00:46:40.661
<font color=#0080C0>I hate it.</font>

622
00:46:42.229 --> 00:46:43.597
<font color=#0080C0>But we just got here.</font>

623
00:46:43.631 --> 00:46:46.467
<font color=#0080C0>I know, but sometimes
