766
00:58:07.147 --> 00:58:08.282
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah.</font>

767
00:58:08.316 --> 00:58:09.350
<font color=#0080C0>You can let go.</font>

768
00:58:10.384 --> 00:58:12.286
